#18800
Immortal Room for zone 188.~
You are standing in a chamber, floating high above the prosperous city of
Kir Amaroth.  The walls of the chamber are richly decorated with art works 
collected from different regions of the known world.  In the center of the
room floats a map, and directly under the map is an opening in the floor
leading to the center of the great city Kir Amaroth.
~
