#18815
Center of Town~
You have reached the center of the city of Kir Amaroth.  You are overwhelmed
 by the sight of an enormous fountain here.  The fountain is constructed of the 
finest marble you have ever seen.  Decorating the fountain are full sized 
statues of twelve dancing women.  The craftsmanship is so excellent you
can almost believe they are alive.  Alas, they are not.  The world is not 
blessed with such lively beautiful women.
From here the road continues in all directions.
To the east and south are the gates to the city.
On the northern side of town, you can see the spires of two temples, and
the rooftop of the governor's mansion.
To the west, you can hear the ocean lapping against the docks.  And 
down the street you spot men dressed in sailor's garb.
~
