Inside the Temple~
You step within the temple. 
Almost every square inch of this temple is either inlaid with gold or 
jewels.  Crystal sculptures of warriors line the wall.  Each armed and 
armored in delicately crafted armaments.  Wreaths of finely woven flowers
lay at the feet of each sculpture.
