#18839
Governor's Office~
You have entered into a truly powerful office.
From here the governor of Kir Amaroth control the life and the economy of
this thriving port city.  
The walls are a deep forest green.  Painting of various other trading 
cities have been hung on the walls.  A enormous mahogany table dominates
the room.  It stands upon elaborately woven area rug of foreign origins,
and is surrounded by ten chairs.
~
