#18840
Barracks~
You have entered into the barracks of the Kir Amarothian Guard.
Bunks line the walls.
The walls are decorated with frescos depicting the victories of the
Kir Amarothian army.  In one fresco, a huge red dragon is perched atop one
of Kir Amaroth's white towers, his fiery breath igniting all it touches.
Directly above that fresco is a sun-bleached fractured largest skull of 
a dragon you have ever seen.  You can not imagine how large the body 
must have been.  But using the scale in the fresco you can picture its
true horrific size.
~
