#18841
Talkin Road~
You stand on a main street of Kir Amaroth.  To the south, you face one side of
the governor's mansion.  You look up and see his wrought iron balcony, 
just outside his private bedroom.  If only you could live in such luxury.
To the north is the entrance to a beautiful shrine.
Over the door is carved "Those who fell against the dragon."
On each side of the door are list of names, and sculpted into the door jams
are life-size images of lamenting women.  This must have been a truly
sad event.
