#18843
The Shrine~
As you enter, you can here the screaming and crying of loss, coming from
private rooms thought the shrine.  
Hundreds of half sized marble statues are lounged on a ledge that follows
the inside perimeter of this shrine.  The statues are of soldiers,
merchants, women, children, elves, human, kender.  Poor, rich it seemed
not to matter.  The dragon indiscriminately killed all.  Such a horror 
it must have been.
