#18847
Columned Mansion~
You pass between the columns through a beautiful stained glass door into
a even more remarkable interior.  The inside of this home has been 
converted into a miniature garden.  Large cast iron vessels have been set
into the floor and filled with water.  Water lilies and other aquatic
plants have been allowed to grow creating a soothing environment.
Rocks have been mounted to the walls with running water flowing over them
to give the appearance of waterfalls.  Much care and planning must have
gone into this construction.
~
