Merchant's Pier~
This pier is used to unload the trade goods that arrive in Kir Amaroth daily
from across the sea.  The merchants unload their goods, then load items
from Kir Amaroth to be sold in far away ports.
You can here the sea wave gently lapping the posts of the piers.
A few steps to the east is Dock Street.
