The Magical Beasts~
You enter a smoke filled bar.  
From the balcony above you hear the sounds of gentle soothing music.  As 
you peer through the smoke you can make out the silhouettes of a five 
piece band, in the middle of a performance.
Tables and chairs are neatly arranged for the patrons.
Your footsteps echo against the hardwood floors as you approach the bar.
