The Two Women~
You enter a lively dock side bar.
Loud noise and a pungent odor assault you as you enter.
Patrons are seated haphazardly on chairs, and some on tops of tables.
Scantly clad waitresses lean over chairs talking to the patrons.  From 
your point of view, what they are selling is a bit more than just drinks.
You see the bar to the rear of the building.
