#18865
The Two Women~
You are in the rear of the bar.  It is a little quieter back here.
A waitress walks up to you.  By the amount of clothing she is wearing,
you wonder how she keeps harm.  Her flowing shoulder length black hair
frames her beautiful ivory smooth face.  Two eyes, black as polished
obsidian, stare into you.  Her slender frame glides toward you, swaying
gently as a blade of grass.
When she reaches you, you are unsure what to ask.
~
