Entrance to the Cemetary~
You stand at the threshold of the Kir Amarothian cemetery.
You stand among the gravestones and crypts of the long ago fallen.
Your skin begins to tingle and grow cold as you begin to feel as though
someone or something is watching you.
To the south are the wrought iron gates.
To the east is the exit and the road.
