#18879
The Dark Crypt~
You have entered a dark crypt.  The moment you enter you are filled with
a sense of dread.  Bizarre images begin to fill your mind.  You begin to
believe these images are of the people who are buried here, at the moment
of their death.  An unearthly wind whips through the crypt.  The origin
of the wind is unknown, but it is a freezing biting wind.  You hear noises
to the rear of the crypt!
~
