#18880
The Black Crypt~
This part of the crypt is completely black.  Even with your light you can
barely see.  There is only enough light to see.. wait.. within the
darkness you can see figures emerge.  They seem to be composed of the 
darkness in which they dwell.  Is this your imagination, you can't tell.
Wait, what was that?  Something definitely just brushed against your arm.
You look at your arm, at the spot in question.  An irritation has developed,
small wounds appear on your arm.  Something is here!
~
